Name: x11vnc
Description: VNC server for sharing an existing X11 desktop session
Version: 0.9.17-1
Arch: x86_64
URL: https://www.karlrunge.com/x11vnc/
License: See /usr/share/doc/x11vnc/copyright
Maintainer: arkanaOS Team
Dependencies:
  gnutls-libs
  libavahi-client3
  libavahi-common3
  libcrypt1
  libjpeg62-turbo
  liblzo2-2
  libsasl2-2
  libxdamage
  libxfixes
  libxinerama
  libxrandr
  openssl-libs
Provides: Xdummy=/usr/bin/Xdummy, libvncclient.so.1=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libvncclient.so.0.9.15, libvncserver.so.1=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libvncserver.so.0.9.15, x11vnc=/usr/bin/x11vnc
